        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Contemporary Light Duty Commercial Leversets</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese contemporary levers were designed for standard to light duty commercial applications. All locking functions are \r\n <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><b>ADA compliant </b></a> (conform to A117.1 Barrier Free Accessibility Code) with push button locking. Adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged standard with curved lip 2-3/4\" X 1-1/4\" <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-t-strike-plate-don-jo-9234-630\">T-Strike Plate</a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Deltana Light Commercial Door Levers\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prep: Fits standard 2-1/8\" bore hole</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Standard 2-3/4\", Optional 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Case: Steel, Zinc dichromated resists corrosion, heavy duty spring cage.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: T-Strike Plate</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" throw <b>stainless steel</b>.</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Standard SC1 solid brass Schlage \"C\" keyway (for keyed entry function).</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Brass 6 pin cylinder keyed to 5 pins (for keyed functions).</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Warranty: <b>Lifetime Mechanical</b>. 10 Year on Finish</li> -->\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CL701EL.pdf?v=1691095314\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana CL7xxEL Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/commercial-door-bore.gif?v=1704354534\" width=\"376\" height=\"240\" border=\"0\" alt=\"commercial door bore hole diagram\">\r\n<br>\r\n<b><font color=\"red\">Warning Note:</font></b> This is a light commercial lever. They are <b>NOT for use</b> on commercial doors prepped  with Thru-bolt holes. (Thru-bolt holes pictured above). If your door has Thru-bolt holes use: <a href=\"/products/standard-commercial-leversets-global-gal-series\"><b> Standard Duty Commercial Levers</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet)(ANSI# F75): For interior doors that don't need locking. Latchbolt operates by lever from either side.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bathroom or Bedroom)(ANSI# F76): For interior doors that could need locking. Latchbolt operates by lever from either side. Pushing inside turn-button locks outside lever. Unlock by turning inside lever, closing door or turning outside emergency slot.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry (ANSI# F109): For interior/exterior  doors that need security locking. Latchbolt operates by lever from either side. Pushing inside turn-button locks outside lever. Unlock by turning inside lever, closing door or using key outside. Pushing and turning inside turn-button keeps outside lever locked, key will retract latch.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Light Duty Commercial Leversets",
                "description": "ADA compliant contemporary door levers for light duty commercial and heavy duty residential. Available functions include Passage, Privacy and Keyed Entry in your choice of Brushed Chrome or Oil Rubbed Bronze.",
